# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The book — private, never published with the site.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/_book/

# The post-render hook that re-assembles _book/build/book.md. Part of the same
# private toolchain, so it is ignored too; _quarto.yml calls it only if present,
# and it exits quietly when _book/ is absent, so a fresh clone still renders.
/_scripts/sync-book.sh

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Quarto
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build cache and preview state — regenerated on every render.
/.quarto/

# The rendered site. It is a build artefact, not source: the site is rendered
# from these pages by .github/workflows/publish.yml and deployed to GitHub
# Pages as an artefact. Keeping it out of main is what prevents a half-published
# site.
/docs/
/_site/

# Supporting files Quarto writes beside a rendered page (index_files/, ...).
/*_files/

# Execution artefacts from computational documents.
/_freeze/
/.jupyter_cache/
*.knit.md
*.utf8.md

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Python — the _book/ assembly and build scripts
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Editors
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Operating systems
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Pages parked while they are being written
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Holding area for .qmd pages that are not yet published. Kept out of the repo
# so unfinished drafts are not pushed; the live site links to
# under-construction.qmd in their place. Note that a path starting with "_" is
# also ignored by Quarto, so nothing here is ever rendered.
_pages_under_construction/
